51018941221836_7001203908112033143_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1vsIe2c6i-wQ7kNvwEpDBpb&_nc_oc=Adp5VvKZFonlrHxU2tbvuDykUihvGKFTS7XQJlpKMgXor5nICU24Itd5y7-Q0eLz_1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR1fQN0EemEp5f9clgTyuJEurd-eng7e2CvzaUnTobz-g&oe=6B0C7A52"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2683219342135775", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_2683219345469108_8107152980636998334_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yRzq6FSJgxsQ7kNvwE8GNly&_nc_oc=AdpcUmd9dLeq8JiI5sQtbY6JXltFXJ4DQN7yLy60mgp-gCs0Je2FAP_kVq2dp9rR5DQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT3-BXDZnrFo_t2WbRE-gRVx-RgN60dCPJZkGL0RsulkA&oe=6B0C7182"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1112203214942612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596149727_1112203218275945_1695708783626127096_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QL6Llkkgr6cQ7kNvwFz0ZO6&_nc_oc=AdqYpyTsOzySwyz5t8vy4yPejqpAml4Io0Y5_42jX8DQn5AbtL0cDMDYGMqBycf_hfw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ3Ny9di0LKoUNWZIGsUN_OLUVauY1bXcgiVL2uBDu4lA&oe=6B0C6750"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "I Am Penguin", "keywords": ["penguin", "penguinSimulator", "VrSimulator", "animalSimulator", "penguinAdventure"], "long_description": "Small flippers. Big mischief. I Am Penguin is a VR penguin sandbox adventure where swimming, sliding and catching fish are just the beginning. Meet your companion, bother NPCs and dive into a playful mix of exploration, rescue and action.\n\nMOVE LIKE A PENGUIN\nSwim through the water, slide along the ground and run towards your next activity. Catch fish and enjoy life from a penguin's perspective as you explore the sandbox.\n\nMAKE A LITTLE TROUBLE\nInteract with NPCs, irritate them and see how they react to your penguin antics. Try different interactions and turn ordinary encounters into mischievous moments.\n\nRESCUE YOUR COMPANION\nYour adventure has more than fish on the menu. Take on a companion rescue and make your escape from a cave. Put the mischief aside when someone needs your help.\n\nADD A SPLASH OF ACTION\nTry different guns with colourful particle effects. Mix shooting action with your sandbox activities and bring a little extra chaos to your penguin adventure.\n\nFEATURES\n\u2022 VR penguin simulator with sandbox gameplay\n\u2022 Swimming, sliding, running and fish catching\n\u2022 A companion and rescue activities\n\u2022 NPC interactions and playful mischief\n\u2022 A cave escape challenge\n\u2022 Different guns with colourful visual effects\n\nFans of dog and cat simulator games can discover a different animal adventure in I Am Penguin, with swimming, sliding, fish catching and sandbox mischief.\n\nCatch a fish. Rescue a companion. Be the penguin that causes a stir!", "short_description": "Become a mischievous penguin in I Am Penguin, a VR penguin simulator and sandbox adventure! Swim, slide, run, catch fish and tease NPCs. Rescue your companion, escape a cave and try different guns with colourful particle effects. If you enjoy cat or dog simulator games, discover another side of animal adventures through penguin antics and playful chaos. Dive in, explore and make a little trouble!"}]}, "developer_name": "Penguin ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rebel Games Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subs